{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "gearup-api-collection-v2",
    "name": "GearUp API",
    "description": "GearUp Outdoor Gear Rental Platform — Complete API Collection.\n\n## 👤 Test Users\n| Role | Name | Email | Password |\n|------|------|-------|----------|\n| CUSTOMER | Arif Hossain | arif.customer@gearup.com | Pass@1234 |\n| PROVIDER | Summit Gear Co. | summit.provider@gearup.com | Pass@1234 |\n| ADMIN | Admin GearUp | admin@gearup.com | Pass@1234 |\n\n## 🔑 Environment Variables\nSet `baseUrl` to `http://localhost:5000` for local or `https://gearup-backend-4eca.onrender.com` for production.\n\n## 📋 Complete Rental Workflow\n1. Register & Login → 2. Create Category (Admin) → 3. Create Gear (Provider) → 4. Create Rental (Customer) → 5. Approve (Provider) → 6. Pay (Customer) → 7. Mark Picked Up (Provider) → 8. Mark Returned (Provider) → 9. Review (Customer)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
